  "Description":      "Conversation with Emotion: a machine responds to the text and/or speech of a human consistently with the human's utterance and Emotion, detected from the text, the speech and the face, with text, synthetic speech and a face whose lips move in sync with the speech and display the machine Emotion. Automatic Speech Recognition gives the Recognised Text; Natural Language Understanding gives the Text Descriptors and the Refined Text; Entity Speech Description and Entity Face Description give the Speech and Face Descriptors Objects; PS-Text, PS-Speech and PS-Face Interpretation give the Emotion of the Text, Speech and Face as a Personal Status with only the Emotion Factor; Multimodal Emotion Fusion fuses them; Entity Dialogue Processing gives the Machine Text and the Machine Emotion; Text-to-Speech gives the Machine Speech; Video Lip Animation gives the Face of the machine, from a KB of Videos of Faces.",

